<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Caspian starts Light, Eletropaulo.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Caspian starts Light, Eletropaulo.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Caspian Securities said on Friday it had started coverage of Brazilian power distributors Light S.A. and Eletropaulo S.A. with buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- Analysts F. Rowe Michels, Alison Graham and Sylvia Sandoval set a 12-month price target of $411.80 for Light shares, representing a 20 percent gain, and of $217 for Eletropaulo, representing a 22 percent gain.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
